# Rivals' Duel (TargetsWithoutSameCreatureType$, TargetMin$ 2): Grizzly Bears (Bear)
# and Llanowar Elves (Elf Druid) share no creature type, so both are legal
# targets and fight (SpellAbility.java:1559-1565). The Elves die, the Bears take 1.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
tapformana human 6 R
queue targets 1,2
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
castspell human 7
resolvestack
